ce":"shining helm","source_tag":"_t","target":"闪光头盔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2aaac87b58bc13285b844eeef3323467f68d709824b1d9668a0609628299a4c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b74b50d274d6fe1ab85a942fdd4324f9500e60c3bcc8b2fcdb5efe789b7c714b","logical_entry_identity":"1bd42904469f0def189e7e2caadee111b563fcb2cc241c655fa633ae3eccfbfd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Insane","source_tag":"birth descriptor name","target":"疯狂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"385569b8b0ae2252e977ea4e163d4ce2a07390ddaa3cf2cae866cbf298cb4644","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b74c45e0930125f94505e139143f014486650a4433a6e47d4cbfced77217ca1a","logical_entry_identity":"b9a1fa9e79f3015e7f1c418041a38c3d08864af98465312b716f013821ccbc81","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You valiantly fought every creature the arena could throw at you and you emerged victorious!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你勇敢地战胜了竞技场里的所有生物并赢得了最终胜利！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"68c58d555f1a040ef0256ed5af57303e492ccca2df154333f95124698bcb1791","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b74e1ab28b64c250325cc2ed8c1883201229e0c9c56f40865ed9a0938d5f6fa7","logical_entry_identity":"ed0c231f8a4f8e7b5b254656eb6c9b670b65293ab7fe88fe2fc87eba77cb2e6e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Weisman,\n\nBy my ancestors' profits I hope you receive this message in good health and spirits. Please, old friend - there is no need to impress upon me your valour, I know full well how courageous you are. Please, do not go after that... that thing! If I must drag you away physically, that is what I shall do, but I beg of you, please, consider another foe to fight!\n\nYour friend,\n\nRolf.","source_tag":"_t","target":"威斯曼，\n\n祖先保佑，你接到这封信时身体安康。老朋友，你没必要向我证明你的荣誉感，我已完全了解你是多么的勇敢。请千万不要回去和那东西战斗！如果非要那样，你只是在逼我拉你回来，这就是我的选择。但我还是求你，换个战斗的对手吧！\n\n老友，\n罗尔夫。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"17071e73e0c24cd9c6bf45e44294c9336a3d55b10b0238ac40b16f5537ea1e80","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b74e22215269dcebc4fae964ec6c00f685391b1580a523d704d1c3f16290c107","logical_entry_identity":"b8d8937c45590459f5b30a9dc0736dbae39379e96bf2766ad6153388dd196f50","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Why, I will let you share in the fruits of my labors! Each of the three mixtures I shall produce in a quantity sufficient to create three doses: one for me, one for the Brotherhood and their confounded trial... and one for you. I must tell you that time is of the essence. I am not the only one who the Brotherhood invited this year, yet they will accept only one applicant-- the first to complete their trials. I know of at least three others laboring furiously to take my rightful place. Should your aid see me through, then I will reward you beyond even the remarkable elixirs. I've an ancient Lifebinding Emerald that grants great powers of health and healing when used properly. What say you?","source_tag":"_t","target":"哎呀，我会让你分享我的劳动成果！这三种药剂，我每种都会配制出足够三份的剂量：一份归我，一份交给兄弟会去应付他们那该死的考验……还有一份归你。我必须告诉你，时间至关重要。我并非兄弟会今年邀请的唯一人选，而他们只录取一名申请者——最先完成考验的那位。我知道至少还有其他三个人在拼命劳作，想抢夺本该属于我的席位。若在你的帮助下我得以胜出，我给予你的报酬甚至会超越那些非凡的药剂。我有一块古老的生命绑定翡翠，妥善使用时能赋予强大的生命与治疗力量。你意下如何？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1e0c835a5c2f2f3e0d1320b620efc240a721100664b6ba86d620e5ba843e4500","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b74f3c455df250ffe9dbcf5c6fd6fb3906e88e56c9b049e55ee454ceeedb988b","logical_entry_identity":"a03007b07a73ba520b7c007a8fadd8988b46ab67ab5d58958d4fa4a0391241a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enhances your Deadly Poison with a volatile agent, causing the poison to deal %d%% increased damage to the victim and damage all of your enemies adjacent to it for 50%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的武器上涂上传染毒素，毒素造成额外 %d%% 伤害，且会对周围敌人造成 50%% 的伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d5d98331e8b02c7a0f7aba929b7aad3ea8c033647fc4ce0e59a00b4be7dc56e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b75180262391a6d4479c01c458dfc6fca9392957df8f0c18e2a29c18a876d6ea","logical_entry_identity":"c8f8a56a0fa2723ea99010826810bc74cff05708eece13c17f16237638e5ff25","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dire Plague rips out a piece of %s soul!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"恐怖瘟疫撕裂了%s灵魂的一部分！"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}}